  "decision_conditions": [
    "The development hereby permitted shall begin not later than the expiration of three years from the date of this permission.",
    "&lt;p&gt;The development hereby permitted shall be carried out in accordance with the following approved plans and thereafter maintained as such for the lifetime of the development:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;E.R.K Structural + Design Consultancy Design Access Statement&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Site Location Plan 24/March/2024&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;GUZEL-02-PL01 Feb/2024&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;GUZEL-02-PL02 Feb/2024&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;GUZEL-02-PL03 Feb/2024&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;GUZEL-02-PL04 Feb/2023&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;GUZEL-02-PL05 Feb/2024&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;GUZEL-02-PL06 Feb/2024&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;GUZEL-02-PL07 Feb/2024&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;GUZEL-02-PL08 Feb/2024&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;GUZEL-02-PL09 Feb/2023&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;GUZEL-02-PL010 Feb/2024&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;GUZEL-02-PL011 Feb/2024&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;M.GUZEL-05-PL12 Feb/2024&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif&quot;&gt;The application\r\nas submitted comprises of insufficient detailing, relating to (i) ambiguous\r\nreasoning for the use of the new access point at the rear of the site, (ii) insufficient\r\nground floor plans so that a comparison between the existing and proposed\r\ninternal arrangements is not possible, and (iii) incorrect labelling of the proposed\r\nrear elevation as ‘existing rear elevation’. As such, it is not possible to\r\nmake a proper assessment of the application in terms of change in the nature of\r\nuse of the site and implications for neighbouring properties&amp;nbsp;or to\r\nestablish that the development complies with policies 5, 6, 42, 53, 57 of the\r\nWaltham Forest Local Plan LP1 (2024).&amp;nbsp;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
